      "value" : "RNA-seq of M-CSF differentiated human peripheral monocyte-derived macrophages (MDMs) activated with short exposure (3hours) to LPS, or long exposure (24 hours) to LPS, LPS with IFNγ, IFNγ, IL-4, IL-10, and dexamethasone"
    }, {
