    }, {
      "name" : "Organism",
      "value" : "Homo sapiens"
    }, {
      "name" : "Description",
      "value" : "The goal of this experiment was to validate a classification model built on other bulk transcriptomic data that was capable of identifying in vitro stimulated M-CSF differentiated macrophages. Specifically, the classification model was capable of distinguishing: M-LPSearly (2-4 hours) M-LPSlate  (18-24 hours)  M-LPS+IFNγ M-IFNγ M-IL4 M-IL-10 M-dex"
    } ],
